WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.107
The multihead weigher and bagger convert frozen
loose fries into sealed bags.

00:00:05.177 --> 00:00:07.948
The checkweigher supplies the evidence for
release.

00:00:08.158 --> 00:00:14.012
Connect checkweigher net weight to AI09 and the
bag discharge request to DO09.

00:00:14.082 --> 00:00:17.712
A discharge request cannot substitute for a
valid weight.

00:00:17.922 --> 00:00:21.528
Set the training net bag target to 1,000 grams.

00:00:21.598 --> 00:00:24.748
Use net product mass for the bag calculation.

00:00:24.958 --> 00:00:27.277
Inject the invalid checkweigher signal.

00:00:27.347 --> 00:00:31.276
Hold bag release until a reference pack verifies
the measurement.

00:00:31.486 --> 00:00:34.517
Restore checkweight and verify a reference pack.

00:00:34.587 --> 00:00:44.509
From 744.7 kilograms, the model records 744
whole bags and a 0.7 kilogram remainder.
